844-/// `MODULE_MEMBERS` cannot see any of that, because each of those spellings is
845-/// exactly one the table does not list.
846-///
847-/// So this walks the other way: eleven modules against every short name a program
848-/// could ask one for ([`short_member_names`]), and every pair that is not a
849-/// spelling a document writes is refused by its dotted spelling. Both engines run
850-/// each one, because the two resolve a dotted call against the same table and a
